# Hugging Face Training Launch Contract

REQUIRED_LAUNCH_CONTRACT: DOCKERFILE_HF_ONLY

- Every training or rendering job must use an immutable image named
  `himalaya-hf` or `himalaya-g1-hf`, pinned as `@sha256:<64 hex>`.
- The image must be built from `Dockerfile.hf` with `requirements-hf.txt`.
- Before training, require `/opt/himalaya-image/menagerie-ready` and require
  `/opt/himalaya-image/provenance` to contain exactly `Dockerfile.hf`.
- Never install system or Python dependencies as an in-job fallback.
- If image provenance is absent or mismatched, fail before allocating training.

